375 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Hero\072 \034hhmm\056\056\056\035\n\nUnknown\072 \052thump thump thump\052\n\nHero\072 \056\056\056\n\nUnknown\072 \034HELLO\077\035 \052THUMP THUMP THUMP\052\n\nUnknown\072 \034I KNOW YOU\031RE IN THERE\056\056\056\035\n\nHero\072 \034Five more minutes won\047t matter\056\056\056\042\n\nUnknown\072 \056\056\056\n\nUnknown\072 \034Are you ignoring me\077\035\n\nUnknown\072 \056\056\n\nHero\072 \042They\047ll give up eventually\056\035\n\nUnknown\072 \034COME OUT\054 I WANT TO TALK\041\035 \052THUMP THUMP THUMP\052\n\n\n\052The hero slowly rolls out of bed\052\n\nHero\072 Mom Probably ordered dinner\056\n\nplayer clicks curtain\n\nHero\072 I should really clean those\056\056\056\n\nplayer clicks door\n\n\052The hero goes downstairs\052\n\n)
